* tb_adc3_points.cir -- R1 ADC revision 3: both slices in parallel, one held differential input per slot and slice.
* Slot s (sampling edge 0.6 us + s * 0.6 us): slice A samples vda (SIN path), slice B samples vdb (COS path).
* vda/vdb are PWL sources written by sim/r3/run_points3.py (value of slot s applied 550 ns before its edge).
* Inputs are linear E sources around the common mode CM (revision 3, R2-7: no B sources on the input path).
* Reference: REFLINES (ideal source, or r1_refbuf3 from an ideal 1.045 V bandgap node).
* Substitutions: CORNER TEMP VDD CM CORE TIMING OPTS TMAX TSTOP PWLA PWLB REFLINES SAVE RAW
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerCAP.lib cap_typ
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOShv.lib mos_ff
.lib /foss/pdks/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerRES.lib res_typ
.include schematic/r1_adc_r3.spice
.include sim/r3/r1_adc_timing_r3_vdd132.inc
.temp -40
.option reltol=1e-4 vntol=1e-6 abstol=1e-12 method=trap klu rshunt=1e12 interp

Vdd vdd 0 1.32
Vref vref 0 1.0
Vcm vcm 0 0.6
Vda vda 0 PWL(0 -0.4589932 6.500000e-07 -0.4589932 6.600000e-07 -0.4587699 1.250000e-06 -0.4587699 1.260000e-06 -0.4585465 1.850000e-06 -0.4585465 1.860000e-06 -0.4583233 2.450000e-06 -0.4583233
+ 2.460000e-06 -0.4581000 3.050000e-06 -0.4581000 3.060000e-06 -0.4578766 3.650000e-06 -0.4578766 3.660000e-06 -0.4576534 4.250000e-06 -0.4576534 4.260000e-06 -0.4574301 4.850000e-06 -0.4574301
+ 4.860000e-06 -0.4572067 5.450000e-06 -0.4572067 5.460000e-06 -0.4569835 6.050000e-06 -0.4569835 6.060000e-06 -0.4567602 6.650000e-06 -0.4567602 6.660000e-06 -0.4565368 7.250000e-06 -0.4565368
+ 7.260000e-06 -0.4563136 7.850000e-06 -0.4563136 7.860000e-06 -0.4560903 8.450000e-06 -0.4560903 8.460000e-06 -0.4558669 9.050000e-06 -0.4558669 9.060000e-06 -0.4556437)
Vdb vdb 0 PWL(0 -0.4588815 6.500000e-07 -0.4588815 6.600000e-07 -0.4586582 1.250000e-06 -0.4586582 1.260000e-06 -0.4584349 1.850000e-06 -0.4584349 1.860000e-06 -0.4582116 2.450000e-06 -0.4582116
+ 2.460000e-06 -0.4579883 3.050000e-06 -0.4579883 3.060000e-06 -0.4577650 3.650000e-06 -0.4577650 3.660000e-06 -0.4575417 4.250000e-06 -0.4575417 4.260000e-06 -0.4573184 4.850000e-06 -0.4573184
+ 4.860000e-06 -0.4570951 5.450000e-06 -0.4570951 5.460000e-06 -0.4568718 6.050000e-06 -0.4568718 6.060000e-06 -0.4566485 6.650000e-06 -0.4566485 6.660000e-06 -0.4564252 7.250000e-06 -0.4564252
+ 7.260000e-06 -0.4562019 7.850000e-06 -0.4562019 7.860000e-06 -0.4559786 8.450000e-06 -0.4559786 8.460000e-06 -0.4557553 9.050000e-06 -0.4557553 9.060000e-06 -0.4555320)
Esp sinp vcm vda 0 0.5
Esn sinn vcm vda 0 -0.5
Ecp cosp vcm vdb 0 0.5
Ecn cosn vcm vdb 0 -0.5
Vip isap 0 0.6
Vin isan 0 0.6

XADC sinp sinn cosp cosn isap isan isap isan trka0 trka1 trkb0 trkb1 mclk wina winb lata latb
+ stb0 stb1 stb2 stb3 stb4 stb5 stb6 stb7 stb8 stb9 stb10 stb11 stb12 stb13
+ rawa rawb topap topan topbp topbn vdd vref 0 r1_adc3_core_fast

.control
set num_threads=1
save v(rawa) v(rawb)
tran 1n 9.9000u 0 0.2n
meas tran idd avg i(vdd) from=0.7u to=9.9000u
write <G1_RESULTS_ROOT>/r1_adc/r3-win-ffm40-c1024/codes.raw
.endc
.end
